# COMPONENT

## DesignedSync

### PACKAGE

org.sample.designedsync

### DESCRIPTION

Designed-sync command sample component for item management.

### SPECIFICATION

This component demonstrates a command that is synchronous by design.

### DOMAIN_INTENT

One runtime surface is modeled:
1. Command side (`Item` service): create an item through an immediate command path.

### LIFECYCLE

Typical flow:
1. `createItem` on the command side

# SERVICE

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Item-facing designed-sync command.

### OPERATION

#### createItem

##### DESCRIPTION

Creates a new item immediately through the command side.

##### TYPE
COMMAND

##### EXECUTION
sync

##### INPUT

###### TYPE
CreateItem

##### OUTPUT

###### TYPE
CreateItemResult
# ENTITY

## Item

### DESCRIPTION

Shared item entity used by the designed-sync command.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type     | multiplicity |
|-------+----------+--------------|
| id    | entityid | 1            |
| name  | name     | 1            |
| title | string   | 1            |

# COMMAND

## CreateItem

### DESCRIPTION

Command to create an item immediately.

### ATTRIBUTE

| name  | type   | multiplicity |
|-------+--------+--------------|
| name  | name   | 1            |
| title | string | 1            |
